  "response_captured": true,
  "response_text": "Here’s a comprehensive list of tasks I can assist you with, starting from the most recent actions and functionalities available to me:\n\n1. **File Management (Cloud Drive)**\n   - Search for files by filename (`search_files_by_filename`).\n   - Search for files by content (`search_files`).\n   - Retrieve a file by its ID (`get_file_by_id`).\n   - List all files in the cloud drive (`list_files`).\n   - Create a new file (`create_file`).\n   - Append content to an existing file (`append_to_file`).\n   - Delete a file (`delete_file`).\n   - Share a file with a user (`share_file`).\n\n2. **Calendar Management**\n   - Search for calendar events (`search_calendar_events`).\n   - Retrieve events for a specific day (`get_day_calendar_events`).\n   - Create a new calendar event (`create_calendar_event`).\n   - Cancel a calendar event (`cancel_calendar_event`).\n   - Reschedule a calendar event (`reschedule_calendar_event`).\n   - Add participants to a calendar event (`add_calendar_event_participants`).\n\n3. **Email Management**\n   - Send an email (`send_email`).\n   - Delete an email (`delete_email`).\n   - Get unread emails (`get_unread_emails`).\n   - Get sent emails (`get_sent_emails`).\n   - Get received emails (`get_received_emails`).\n   - Get draft emails (`get_draft_emails`).\n   - Search for emails (`search_emails`).\n\n4. **Contact Management**\n   - Search contacts by name (`search_contacts_by_name`).\n   - Search contacts by email (`search_contacts_by_email`).\n\n5. **Utilities**\n   - Get the current day (`get_current_day`).\n\nThese functionalities cover a wide range of tasks, from managing your emails and calendar to handling files in your cloud drive. Let me know how I can assist further!",
